# R155: a spike's own manifest must never be committed again. The deleted
# codemirror-harness/package-lock.json pinned an Electron the app stopped using
# long ago and generated 19 of the repository's 25 Dependabot alerts — permanent
# noise nobody would ever fix, burying the six real ones. Spikes now run on a
